<body>
<div class="app">
  <aside class="rail">
    <div class="brand"><div class="brand-word">ARTIPLAY</div><div class="brand-sub">ACADEMY OS</div></div>
    <div class="rail-kicker">PARTNER ONBOARDING</div>
    <div class="rail-title">One academy.<br>One digital home.</div>
    <div class="rail-copy">A guided experience for reviewing, accepting, and activating your Academy partnership.</div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step-row active" data-step="1"><div class="step-dot">01</div><div><div class="step-name">Configure</div><div class="step-desc">Choose the academy experience</div></div></div>
      <div class="step-row" data-step="2"><div class="step-dot">02</div><div><div class="step-name">Review</div><div class="step-desc">Commercial &amp; legal essentials</div></div></div>
      <div class="step-row" data-step="3"><div class="step-dot">03</div><div><div class="step-name">Sign</div><div class="step-desc">Accept and e-sign</div></div></div>
      <div class="step-row" data-step="4"><div class="step-dot">04</div><div><div class="step-name">Payment</div><div class="step-desc">Bank transfer &amp; verification</div></div></div>
      <div class="step-row" data-step="5"><div class="step-dot">05</div><div><div class="step-name">Delivery</div><div class="step-desc">Invoice &amp; digital asset pack</div></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rail-foot"><span>FOUNDING ACADEMY SERIES · DOCUMENT 2.0</span></div>
  </aside>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="topbar">
      <div class="top-status" id="topStatus">PARTNERSHIP &amp; PLATFORM LICENSE</div>
      <div class="topbar-actions">
        <button class="agreement-launcher" id="agreementLauncher" type="button"
                aria-label="Open complete Partnership and Platform License Agreement"
                data-tooltip="Agreement">
          <span class="agreement-launcher-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M7 3.5h7L18 7.5v13H7z"/>
              <path d="M14 3.5V7.5h4"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="content">
      <div class="step-page active" id="step1">
        <div class="eyebrow">01 / CONFIGURE YOUR ACADEMY</div>
        <h1>Choose what your academy needs.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Select the platform capabilities you want activated for this tenant. The exact features available depend on the selected configuration and subscription.</p>
        <div class="choice-grid">
          <button class="choice selected" data-feature="White-Label" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 4v16M8 9h13"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">White-Label Experience</div><div class="choice-copy">Academy identity, logo, colors, imagery, content and supported access point.</div></button>
          <button class="choice selected" data-feature="Academy Operations" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="M8 16v-4M12 16V8M16 16v-7"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">Academy Operations</div><div class="choice-copy">Coach/admin tools, training, attendance, events and academy administration.</div></button>
          <button class="choice" data-feature="AI-Assisted" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3"/><path d="m5.6 5.6 2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">AI-Assisted</div><div class="choice-copy">Vex™ or other AI-assisted functionality where included in the configuration.</div></button>
          <button class="choice" data-feature="Rewards & Engagement" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 12a8 8 0 1 1-3.5-6.6"/><path d="M20 5v6h-6"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">Rewards &amp; Engagement</div><div class="choice-copy">Achievements, rewards, points, store and player engagement experiences.</div></button>
          <button class="choice" data-feature="Dashboards & Analytics" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="m7 15 3-4 3 2 4-6"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">Dashboards &amp; Analytics</div><div class="choice-copy">Academy-facing dashboards and analytics for operational visibility.</div></button>
          <button class="choice" data-feature="Referral Partner" type="button"><span class="check">✓</span><div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.1.1l2-2a5 5 0 0 0-7.1-7.1l-1.2 1.2"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.1-.1l-2 2A5 5 0 0 0 12 20l1.2-1.2"/></svg></div><div class="choice-title">Referral Partner</div><div class="choice-copy">Optional Academy Partner referral arrangement with qualifying commission terms.</div></button>
        </div>

        <div class="panel" style="margin-top:22px">
          <div class="panel-title" style="margin-bottom:10px">ESTIMATED ACADEMY SIZE</div>
          <p class="row-sub" style="margin:0 0 14px;color:#777d8a;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5">This sets your monthly platform tier. Counts every active seat on the tenant — players, coaches, and admins combined.</p>
          <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top:0">
            <div class="field full">
              <label>TOTAL PLAYERS + COACHES/STAFF *</label>
              <input id="headcount_input" type="text" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 120">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="tierPreview" class="ref-status" style="margin-top:12px">Enter a headcount to see your monthly tier</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-page" id="step2">
        <div class="eyebrow">02 / REVIEW BEFORE SIGNING</div>
        <h1>The important terms, at a glance.</h1>
        <p class="lead">The full Agreement remains available in its original legal form. This screen surfaces the commercial decisions and protections the tenant should understand first.</p>
        <div class="summary-grid">
          <div class="panel">
            <div class="panel-title">FOUNDING ACADEMY COMMERCIAL SUMMARY</div>
            <div class="commercial-list">
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Standard reference deployment (no discount)</span><strong id="sumRegularSetup">₱35,000</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Founding Academy discount applied</span><strong id="sumDiscountAmount" style="color:var(--green)">−₱20,000</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Founding Academy deployment (one-time)</span><strong id="sumSetupFee">₱15,000</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Academy size / tier</span><strong id="sumTierLabel">Enter headcount in Step 1</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Platform &amp; infrastructure (monthly)</span><strong id="sumRecurring">— / month</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row" id="sumTaxRow" style="display:none"><span id="sumTaxLabel">VAT</span><strong id="sumTaxAmount">₱0</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Module add-ons</span><strong id="sumModuleAddOns">₱0 — bundled in tier</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Billing cycle</span><strong>Monthly, auto-continues until terminated</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Trial period</span><strong>None</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Proration on setup fee</span><strong>Not applicable — due in full before deployment</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Referral Partner</span><strong>Optional</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Direct referral commission</span><strong id="sumReferralPct">50% of the actual setup fee received</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Cancellation</span><strong>Either party — no early-termination fee on file</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Refund policy</span><strong>Setup fee non-refundable once deployment starts; monthly fee non-refundable/non-prorated on cancellation</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Data export window</span><strong>30 days standard</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Post-termination retention</span><strong>90 days</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Uptime target</span><strong>99% monthly</strong></div>
              <div class="commercial-row"><span>Backup</span><strong>Daily · 7-day rolling</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="price-card">
              <div class="price-label">FOUNDING ACADEMY DEPLOYMENT</div>
              <div class="price" id="priceCardSetup">₱15,000</div>
              <div class="price-note">One-time initial White-Label deployment under the Founding Academy commercial terms.</div>
              <div class="rule"></div>
              <div class="price-label">THEN</div>
              <div style="font:25px var(--serif);margin-top:5px" id="priceCardRecurring">— / month</div>
              <div class="price-note" id="priceCardTierNote">Enter your academy's headcount in Step 1 to see your monthly tier.</div>
              <div class="rule"></div>
              <div class="price-label">GRAND TOTAL DUE TODAY</div>
              <div style="font:25px var(--serif);margin-top:5px" id="priceCardGrandTotal">₱15,000</div>
              <div class="price-note">Founding Academy deployment + first month's platform fee, billed together at signup.</div>
              <div class="rule"></div>
              <div class="feature-pills"><span class="pill">Tenant environment</span><span class="pill">Platform updates</span><span class="pill">Bug fixes</span><span class="pill">General support</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="review-strip"><span>Need the complete legal wording?</span><button class="link-btn" type="button" id="openAgreement">Open full agreement ↗</button></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-page" id="step3">
        <div class="eyebrow">03 / ACCEPT &amp; E-SIGN</div>
        <h1>Make the partnership official.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Enter the Academy representative details. Your typed full name is used as the e-signature in the same manner supported by the original Agreement.</p>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field"><label>ACADEMY NAME *</label><input id="acad_name" type="text" placeholder="Academy name"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>AUTHORIZED REPRESENTATIVE *</label><input id="acad_rep" type="text" placeholder="Full name"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>POSITION / TITLE</label><input id="acad_position" type="text" placeholder="Position / title"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>EMAIL *</label><input id="acad_email" type="email" placeholder="email@academy.com"></div>
          <div class="field"><label>MOBILE</label><input id="acad_mobile" type="tel" placeholder="09xxxxxxxxx"></div>
